    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318990/extras/f3d78eba617230f3e354b6ac618c316b.avif?t=1754497033\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord link on the right panel</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of <strong>Web Host Simulator</strong>, you'll establish a web hosting company from your small apartment, aiming to become the leading hosting service provider. But success requires more than attracting customers; you must also handle challenges like cyberattacks, outages and others events! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Different types of product for sale:</strong> VPS, Dedicated server and more coming soon; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Different types of equipment:</strong>\u00a0Network switch, servers and more; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Hardware assembly:</strong> Assemble and optimize equipment; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Immersive environments:</strong> Navigate graphical and command-line operating systems; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Internet in-game:</strong> Explore immersive websites; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Realistic cables:</strong> Manage cables with real-time physics simulation; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Upcoming features:</strong> Stay tuned for updates during development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to turn your small company into a hosting provider empire?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of <strong>Web Host Simulator</strong>, you'll establish a web hosting company from your small apartment, aiming to become the leading hosting service provider. But success requires more than attracting customers; you must also handle challenges like cyberattacks, outages and others events! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Different types of product for sale:</strong> VPS, Dedicated server and more coming soon; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Different types of equipment:</strong>\u00a0Network switch, servers and more; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Hardware assembly:</strong> Assemble and optimize equipment; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Immersive environments:</strong> Navigate graphical and command-line operating systems; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Internet in-game:</strong> Explore immersive websites; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Realistic cables:</strong> Manage cables with real-time physics simulation; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Upcoming features:</strong> Stay tuned for updates during development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to turn your small company into a hosting provider empire?</p>",
